      "html": "<div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>☧Σ<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΧΡΙΣΙΑΝΗΣ<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΣΕΜΝΗΣΑΓΑΝΟ<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΦΡΟΝΟ.[..]ΕΦΙΛΑΝ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΔΡ<span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ο͡Υ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νασσιανῆς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νασσιανῆς\"><span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Ν</span>ΑΣ.ΙΑΝΗΣ</span></span>ΤΥΜ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΒΟΝΕΙΣΟΡΑΣΦΙΛΕΚΙΜΕΝΟΝ<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>[....].ΙΣΣΕΜΝΟΣΥΝΗΣΙΝ<br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>[.....]ΤΟ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Πηνελοπίη\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πηνελοπίη\">ΠΗΝΕΛΟΠΙΗ</span></span>⸙<br id=\"al9-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>☧<br id=\"al10-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΕΝΘΑΔΕΚΙΤΕ<br id=\"al11-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">11</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Νασσιανὴ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Νασσιανὴ\">[....]ΙΑΝΗ</span></span>ΖΗΣΑΣΑ<br id=\"al12-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">12</span>[......]ΚΑΛΩ<span class=\"small\" title=\"small character: ς\">Σ</span>ΚΑΙΑΜΕΜ<br id=\"al13-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">13</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;ΠΤΩΣΕΤΗ<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ΛΒ</span><br id=\"al14-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">14</span>ΜΗΝΑΣ·Ι·</span></div><p class=\